<title>MEXICO: Electronics firms coming to Mexico in '97 - industry.</title>
<headline>Electronics firms coming to Mexico in '97 - industry.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sixteen international electronics firms plan to open new plants in Mexico's western state of Jalisco, an industry spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Eighty-four (international) firms have shown an interest in investing in Jalisco, of which 16 have already fixed a date for doing so,&quot; said Emigdio Franco, head of the Jalisco National Electronics Industry Chamber said.</p>
<p>Franco declined to name the firms.</p>
<p>--Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau +523 817-0397</p>
</text>
